      "role": "user",
      "content": "cool. okay so lets try these: \n\n1. using \"no cap\" in ads\n2. minimalist/quiet luxury aesthetic\n3. drill music/rap culture vibes\n4. brunch/aeshetic cafe culture\n\ncan you rank these from most sophisticated to least sophisticated and tell me what kind of demographic each one targets?",
